## Model card

- **Identity:** Primary model **`LongCat-2.5-Preview`**,released **2026-09-25**,not LongCat2.0/Flash-Thinking or a verified separate final2.5 checkpoint. Current OpenCode **`longcat-2.5-preview-free`** maps through models.dev to canonical **`meituan/longcat-2.5-preview`**.[1][2][5]
- **Repository identity finding:** Curated metadata for existing **`longcat_2.5_preview`** and **`longcat-2.5-preview`** both identify **`opencode/longcat-2.5-preview-free`**. This is a duplicate naming record,not evidence of two checkpoints. Only identity metadata was inspected,no peer findings or scores. Existing folders/files are preserved;no parking,merge or deletion performed. No second distinct model quality score is invented to distinguish spelling.
- **Access:** Native **`https://api.longcat.chat/openai/v1/chat/completions`** and Anthropic-compatible Messages;primary navigation also documents Responses. Current **`https://opencode.ai/inference/v1/models`** returned200 and includes exact free ID. Native unauthenticated model-list request returned401 missing key;this is not model unavailability. No authenticated inference performed.[2][6][7]
- **Context / output:** Primary model-parameter table **1,048,576 shared input+output /262,144 max output**,thinking budget up to262,144. OpenCode/models.dev **1,000,000/131,072**,while older native chat/retrieval examples and secondary October12/13 account describe128K output. These are source/route distinctions,not interchangeable guarantees. No direct retrieval-quality evidence found.[3][5][8]
- **Modalities / tools:** Primary release announces image understanding;current models.dev says **text/image→text**,reasoning/tool calls. Primary Retrieve Model **example** still says text→text;its sample is not a live authenticated response. Working image inference was not tested and no visual score assigned. No audio/video/generation inherited from older Omni models.[1][2][5]
- **Modes / sampling:** Native **temperature1.0 thinking-on/0.7 off,fixed and overridden rather than arbitrary customization**,top-p0.95 default,top-k−1 default,explicit thinking switch/budget. These current parameter rules supersede assumptions drawn from old generic samples.[3]
- **Pricing (2026-10-21):** Primary **limited-time $0.30 uncached input/$1.20 output/$0.006 cached per1M**. Current OpenCode docs/catalog advertise **$0 free route**,limited-time,provider **zero retention/no training** per its exact-model statement. This is verified tariff/access metadata,not quality evidence or a guarantee of unlimited availability.[4][6][7]
- **Architecture / weights / knowledge:** No exact parameter count,active count,downloadable released weights,training cutoff or weight licence verified. LongCat2.0's1.6T/48B/MIT cannot be imported merely through family naming.[1][8]

### Raw benchmarks found

- **No verified exact-model task-success benchmark found** for coding,tools,reasoning,image perception or long-context retention. “Superior coding”,tool compatibility,1M context and free price are not measured quality results.[1][3][4]
- Exact AA **`longcat-2-5-preview`**,Vals **`meituan_longcat-2.5-preview`** and BenchLM **`longcat-2-5-preview`** candidate pages returned404;OpenRouter's fetched model catalog had no matching2.5 entry. These are dated source/path findings,not proof no benchmark exists anywhere.[9][10][11]
- DuckDuckGo found **AI Coding Daily** with a “Coding Benchmark” title;both web-fetch and direct Node fetch failed transport. Its numerical results/methodology were therefore **not inspected or verified**,and the title is not converted into an invented SWE/terminal score.[12]
- OrcaRouter's dated October12/13 analysis independently reports missing benchmark disclosure and API/vision inconsistencies. It is a **secondary documentation audit**,not an evaluator run. Its128K-output description is bounded to its date and does not overwrite today's explicit native256K parameter table.[3][8]
- No LongCat2.0,Flash-Thinking,Flash-Omni,usage/adoption or unrelated model numbers are substituted. Missing benchmark values are unknown,not zero.

